    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> War sphere, forbidden lore class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You must spend 2 spell points to create a totem of the deepest curse. The area of this totem is desecrated with the aberrations you commune with. Enemies within this totem suffer the effects you currently suffer from due to any backlash you have accumulated.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/thaumaturge#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
